     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRImmunisationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRImmunisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRImmunisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-immunisation</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-vaccination</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.identifiant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation.startDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.effectiveTime.low</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation.endDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.effectiveTime.high</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.diseaseOrAgentTargeted</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.entryRelationship:frProbleme</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.administeredProduct</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.consumable:FRCDAProduitDeSante</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.route</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.routeCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.site</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.approachSiteCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.doseQuantity</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.doseQuantity</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.doseNumber</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.entryRelationship:frRangDeLaVaccination</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.note</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.entryRelationship:frCommentaireER</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.prescription</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.entryRelationship:frPrescription</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.reaction</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAVaccination.entryRelationship:frProbleme</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.reasonCode</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance CDA explicite unique pour reasonCode dans ce profil CDA de vaccination.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-immunisation</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-immunization-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.identifiant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.identifier</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.status</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.occurrencePeriod</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation.startDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.occurrencePeriod.start</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.periodOfImmunisation.endDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.occurrencePeriod.end</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.diseaseOrAgentTargeted</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.protocolApplied.targetDisease</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.administeredProduct</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.vaccineCode</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.route</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.route</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.site</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.site</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.doseQuantity</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.doseQuantity</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.doseNumber</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.protocolApplied.doseNumber</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.note</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRImmunizationDocument.note</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImmunisation.prescription</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\